{"channelId":"UCVUff_dYSAM96i68VTCBDJQ","row":["Hunter Wildlife Rescue",3,"Hunter Wildlife Rescue is a 100% volunteer-run charity that rescues, rehabilitates and releases injured, sick or distressed native animals in Newcastle, Lake Macquarie, Maitland, Cessnock and the Hunter  Valley of NSW.\n\nSpecies we rescue include possums and gliders, koalas, kangaroos and wallabies, wombats, echidnas, turtles, snakes, lizards, all native birds (including owls and raptors).\n\nEstablished in 1978, Hunter Wildlife Rescue (formerly Native Animal Trust Fund) was the first volunteer run wildlife rescue organisation in NSW.","president@hunterwildlife.org.au; secretary@hunterwildlife.org.au; vicepresident@hunterwildlife.org.au; website@hunterwildlife.org.au","Australia"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCVUff_dYSAM96i68VTCBDJQ","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCVUff_dYSAM96i68VTCBDJQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:08:18.005Z"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCVUff_dYSAM96i68VTCBDJQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:08:18.005Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCVUff_dYSAM96i68VTCBDJQ","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":3,"raw":"3 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCVUff_dYSAM96i68VTCBDJQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:08:18.005Z"}],"emails":[{"address":"president@hunterwildlife.org.au","purpose":"unknown","ownerRole":"unknown","identityStatus":"channel_published","sourceUrls":["https://www.hunterwildlife.org.au/contact-us/"],"evidenceIds":["public-page:e0d0fafdded2881e95b887b2"],"observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:44:48.027Z","deliveryVerified":false,"dnsStatus":"unknown","context":"页面原文: Please forward any feedback to: president@hunterwildlife.org.au or by post to the address below.\nHTML href: mailto:president@hunterwildlife.org.au","raw":"president@hunterwildlife.org.au"},{"address":"secretary@hunterwildlife.org.au","p